# Airsupdev isolation

`/airsupdev` is a standalone ops MCP for China supplier outreach workers. Keep it easy to delete.

## Put Airsupdev code only in
- `airsupdev/` (routes, mcp, config, services, tools, tests)
- the marked `AIRSUPDEV-BEGIN` / `AIRSUPDEV-END` blocks in `server/server.js`
- `"airsupdev/**"` in `vercel.json` includeFiles

## Product rules
- MCP: `https://www.tademehl.com/airsupdev/mcp`
- Auth: bearer `AIRSUPDEV_MCP_SECRET` (not Google OAuth)
- Tools are China ops only; they call into `airsup/china/*`
- Never expose raw SQL, delete-supplier, or buyer Airsup tools here

## Do not
- Put ops mint/claim tools on `/airsup/mcp` or `/airsup20/mcp`
- Loosen China discovery gates (`listLive`, `canPublish`, free-mail)
- Add Airsupdev UI to other site pages

## Revert
Delete `airsupdev/`, remove `AIRSUPDEV-*` blocks from `server/server.js`, remove `airsupdev/**` from `vercel.json`.
